    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_drugs_medicinal_botanicals): Named materia medica (castoreum, ginseng, cubebs, scammony, maidenhair, liquorice juice, quassia, cocculus indicus, serpentary, asafoetida, cantharides, hellebore, pipsissewa, ipecacuanha) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 9 rows, 1800–1800. Series: KEW_CUST 5 ×9. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×9. Top routes: France → United Kingdom ×1; Italy → United Kingdom ×1; World → United Kingdom ×1; Germany → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
